\section{Experimental design}\label{sec:design}
Table~\ref{tab:studies} separates observation regimes and training variation. All studies use Meta-World~\cite{metaworld} 3.1.1/MuJoCo 3.3.0, a native 500-step horizon and mean native reward $U\in[0,10]$. Any-success records at least one native success event; terminal-success records the final step. Option branches and repeated policies are not independent environments. Online Resource 1 retains full training, condition, replay and provenance details.
